Third-party software and assets
-------------------------------

chessfen
  https://github.com/sunfmin/chessfen, by sunfmin
  License: GPL-3.0
  Used for screenshot recognition. Not included in this repository: pip installs it
  from a pinned commit (see requirements.txt).

python-chess
  https://github.com/niklasf/python-chess, by Niklas Fiekas
  License: GPL-3.0-or-later
  Used for board logic, FEN handling and the board diagrams. Installed by pip.

ChessLens
  https://github.com/zeljko1611/ChessLens, by zeljko1611
  License: MIT (see app/vision/LICENSE)
  Board detection and square-cropping code in app/vision/ (vendored with changes), and
  the photo recognition model, which is downloaded at setup from a pinned commit.
  The model was trained on chesscog renders (https://osf.io/xf3ka/, Wölflein and
  Arandjelović, CC BY 4.0) and samryan18/chess-dataset photos (MIT).

Noto Sans Symbols 2
  https://github.com/notofonts/symbols, by the Noto Project Authors
  License: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (see static/pieces-OFL.txt)
  Chess piece outlines used by the web page (static/pieces.js).

samryan18/chess-dataset
  https://github.com/samryan18/chess-dataset
  License: MIT (see tests/data/README.md)
  One downscaled photo used by the tests (tests/data/board.jpg).

Stockfish
  https://stockfishchess.org/
  License: GPL-3.0
  Installed separately by the user and run as a separate program; not included.
